{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y部分叙述压缩后削弱了心理转折的因果交代，例如S03没有明确保留仍憋着一股气却又短暂高兴的内在反差，X在这些地方更容易让人理解人物为什么这样。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合边听边扫：话句中的重点被直接突出，感受又按音乐进程出现，不必同时面对一整堆情绪词，比较容易抓住每段发生了什么。它的音乐感受也更具体，能把节奏、音型、音色、力度变化与人物心理联系起来，尤其是从焦灼、怀念、短暂安宁到重新不安的细微变化，比X更有层次。X的优势是叙述更完整，部分心理动机和转折交代得更充分，但整体而言，Y更容易让普通观众在听音乐的同时既跟住故事，又感受到音乐如何推动故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ede87c32-938b-45e5-8130-e705cbe6fa83", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T224933005192Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:50:14.890910+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c5584b9b8983a6b8f394ce3551b6886026441eb22950bd934729cbf976c531ff", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3